                plsqlCode:
                    ```plsql
                    delete from CCINVOICETAC where tno = :P175_TNO;
                    insert into CCINVOICETAC
                    (
                        TNO, 
                        SNO, 
                        TERMSANDCONDITIONHEADCODE, 
                        TERMSANDCONDITION
